(FATEQ Technologies was engaged to conduct a comprehensive PLM Maturity Assessment and formulate a 12-Month Digital Transformation) Tj
T* (Roadmap for Apex Industrial Dynamics \(a synthetic mid-market industrial manufacturer\). Apex currently operates a heavily customized Siemens) Tj
T* (Teamcenter environment supporting multi-site mechanical engineering, quality, and production operations. However, legacy technical debt,) Tj
T* (unmanaged spreadsheet-based Manufacturing Bills of Materials \(MBOM\), and fragmented Engineering Change Order \(ECO\) processing have) Tj
T* (constrained operational throughput, resulting in an overall PLM Maturity Rating of Level 2.2 \(Defined Baseline\) on a 5.0 scale.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Key Operational & Architectural Findings:) Tj
T* (• Customization Overkill & Upgrade Blockers: Bypassing out-of-the-box \(OOTB\) active workspace style sheets \(XRT\) and BMIDE configurations in) Tj
T* (favor of legacy C++/ITK custom server scripts has increased maintenance overhead by 300% and blocked platform upgrades.) Tj
T* (• EBOM-to-MBOM Execution Disconnect: Manufacturing Process Planners manually re-key CAD assembly structures into plant Excel) Tj
T* (spreadsheets, causing a 35% shop-floor scrap/rework rate on major revision updates.) Tj
T* (• Protracted Engineering Change Cycles: ECO turnaround currently averages 22 business days due to unintegrated email sign-offs and missing) Tj
T* (cross-domain impact analysis trees.) Tj
T* (• Data Quality & Attribute Gaps: Over 30% of active CAD models lack verified mass and material attributes, invalidating automated Weight &) Tj
T* (Balance rollups and environmental compliance reporting.) Tj
